OL,3,AUS stocks fall further as fears over AI
OL,4,Aintensify
OL,5,
OL,6,FBig technology firms connected to AI
OL,7,Fcontinued to see share prices fall on
OL,8,FWednesday, with stock in Nvidia and
OL,9,FAnthropic dropping sharply in early
OL,10,Ftrading.
OL,12,FAll three main US stock market indices
OL,13,Fwere down, with the tech-dominated
OL,14,FNasdaq shedding almost 4%.
OL,16,FThe declines come amid concerns over
OL,17,Fthe level and sustainability of AI
OL,18,Finvestment which has rattled investors
OL,19,Fin recent weeks.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
